title: Hermann Dietrich
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, democratic
card-image: img/portraits/DietrichHermann.jpg
view-if: dietrich_advisor = 1
new-page: true
#face-image: img/portraits/DietrichHermann.jpg

= Hermann Dietrich

Dietrich is a founding member of the <span style="color: #DCCA4A;">**DDP**</span>. He is an advocate for the peasantry and rural middle classes.

- @agriculture
- @building_the_democrats
- @lautenbach_economic_plan
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@agriculture
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Dietrich can help us outline our economic policy.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and dvp_in_government and agriculture_minister_party == dvp_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not dvp_in_government: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> is not in government. ?] [? if agriculture_minister_party != dvp_name: The <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span> does not control the Agriculture Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; agricultural_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy


@building_the_democrats
title: Building the Democrats
subtitle: Strengthen the position of the democrats within the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; democratic_strength += 10; democratization += 1; democratic_dissent -= 10; industrialist_dissent += 10

We have increased the strength of the democratic faction with the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>.


@lautenbach_economic_plan
title: Support Lautenbach's economic plan
subtitle: Call for a limited program of job creation without deficit spending.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and lautenbach_plan_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if lautenbach_plan_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted Lautenbach's economic plan. ?] [? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : We are not currently in an economic crisis. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: crisis_program.support_lautenbach


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Dietrich" : Dietrich must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Dietrich")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
